<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Take_It.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\作業机.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Huh!? You're taking tomorrow off!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Sorry, there's been a death in the family, and I really can't come in. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I won't be able to help you over the phone when you explain the prototype. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You can handle it alone, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"G-got it... I'll give it a try."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I clapped my junior firmly on the shoulder.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Have confidence! You designed this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You designed it because you thought this was good, right?"</STYLE><PG>
"Y-yes! I'll do my best!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As planned, I applied for paid leave and secured tomorrow off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could probably leave on time today too, so I'd make it to Megasawa City by 22:00.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新村家廊下.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Welcome home."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I got home, only <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> came to greet me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unusually, <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>'s voice had no energy in it.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Where's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">? Is she not feeling well?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see... Will she be okay for the hour to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> parents' place...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, just this once, <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> would have to push herself.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I loaded our things into the car and sat <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> in the back seat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... where are we going now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"We're going to Grandpa and Grandma's house now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, I don't want to go..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Let's go..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\車ドア閉める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車室内エンジン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車走行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "2000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\運転席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "togisuma.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I pretended not to hear and drove off.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The time was 18:40. Even with a stop at <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>'s family home, we had plenty of time. No traffic jams reported either.<PG>
In the end, no good idea had come to me for how to persuade <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hoped some bright idea would come to me before we reached Megasawa.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But one thing bothered me a little. <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> saying she didn't want to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A storm of cherry petals, lit by the streetlights, swept past in front of me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The wind was a little strong today.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I don't want this... You mustn't go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s premonition right?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was there nothing we could do but helplessly kill two children?<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\後部座席夜.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供ぐったり.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In the rear-view mirror I could see <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE>'s limp, drained face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To warn us this hard, she must be summoning every bit of strength she had.<PG>
The car windows were shut tight, so <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> should be feeling better soon, and her danger sense was already over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, if <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> kept insisting this much, she must have foreseen something really bad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Damn... things weren't looking good...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "2000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\外崎家.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―At <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>'s family home, someone was already standing outside waiting for us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was my father-in-law and mother-in-law.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Ryoji-san</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>, you must be tired. Will you rest a bit?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My mother-in-law welcomed us with a beaming smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the same time, I remembered what <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> had told me yesterday.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So this was the person who saw newborn <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-san</STYLE> and made her friends with <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE>.<PG>
I couldn't help thinking it all started with her, but blaming my mother-in-law was wrong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My mother-in-law had only brought the two of them together out of kindness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, she was about to look after <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> for us. I mustn't think like this...<PG>
"Come on, rest just a little, have some tea before you go."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, we have to leave right away."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Sorry for dropping her on you so suddenly."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's fine, it's fine. Come on in, now!" [TN: he speaks a heavy regional dialect.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My father-in-law's dialect was as hard to follow as ever, but he seemed to be welcoming us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I handed <STYLE ID="3">Natsumi</STYLE> over to my father-in-law.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Holding his grandchild, my father-in-law looked delighted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well then, please take care of her."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
